WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:11.140
Just put your little hand back in the cash register and 

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:14.850
give me my $2.75 back, please, Brad.

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:17.470
Sir if you just give me a minute, I'll find the forms.

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:19.870
I'll take care of everything.

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:27.730
[YELLING]

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:33.190
Whoa, what is that? What is that? What is it?

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:36.680
Oh no, not the bees! Not the bees!

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:38.430
[SCREAMS]

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:41.480
They're in my eyes! My eyes! 

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:43.450
He jumped over three linebackers in mid air.

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.720
He sprouted antlers like a Gazelle. [LAUGHS]

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:48.470
Like an Elk. [LAUGHS]

00:00:48.470 --> 00:00:50.220
He landed again. He ran ran ran. 

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:53.930
He scored a touchdown! [LAUGHS]

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:10.300
What is it? What's wrong, sister?

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.160
[SCREAMS]

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:33.880
Your A-B-C-D-E-F-G

00:01:33.880 --> 00:01:37.600
H-I-J-K-L-M-N-O-P

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:38.030
Peter!

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:42.400
Q-R-S-T-U-V-W-X-Y-Z!

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:42.840
[SCREAMS]

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:45.670
That's all you have to do!

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:56.810
[MANIAC LAUGH]

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:10.560
[SCREAMING]

